<ul id="mwAgI"><li id="mwAgM"><span about="#mwt79" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAgQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"US patent","href":"./Template:US_patent"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"4309569"},"2":{"wt":"Merkle tree patent 4,309,569"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US4309569" class="external text">Merkle tree patent 4,309,569</a></span><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Entity" about="#mwt80" id="mwAgU" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"snd","href":"./Template:Snd"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt80">–</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt80"> </span> explains both the hash tree structure and the use of it to handle many one-time signatures</li>
<li id="mwAgY"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20080316033726/http://www.open-content.net/specs/draft-jchapweske-thex-02.html" about="#mwt81" typeof="mw:Transclusion" class="external text" id="mwAgc" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"usurped","href":"./Template:Usurped"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"[https://web.archive.org/web/20080316033726/http://www.open-content.net/specs/draft-jchapweske-thex-02.html Tree Hash EXchange format (THEX)]"}},"i":0}}]}'>Tree Hash EXchange format (THEX)</a><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:Entity" about="#mwt82" id="mwAgg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"snd","href":"./Template:Snd"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt82">–</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt82"> </span> a detailed description of Tiger trees</li></ul>

